Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.14,0:00:34.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,《勇敢者的游戏》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(1869年)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.13,0:00:57.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别怕 一群狼而已 加油干 咱们就要成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, it's a pack of wolves. Come on, we're almost rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.58,0:01:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 凯勒布 它在追我 - 赶紧爬上来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Caleb, it's after me! - Grab on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.77,0:01:20.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快闪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.65,0:01:22.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回来 本杰明 一定要把这祸害埋了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Benjamin, we have to finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.06,0:01:24.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,发什么愣 快动手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, help me bury it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.11,0:01:31.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是某人把它又挖出来呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if someone digs it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:36.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只能祈求上帝保佑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May God have mercy on his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.74,0:01:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(布兰福特特 1英里)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.70,0:02:07.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(新罕布什尔州 布兰福特镇 1969年)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.97,0:02:11.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 嗨 艾伦 - 嗨 迈克鲁德小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Alan. - Hi, Miss Magruder.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.11,0:02:15.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 下午好 艾伦 - 好啊 弗兰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Afternoon, Alan. - Hey, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.38,0:02:23.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 可以过了 艾伦 - 谢了 比尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All yours, Alan. - Thanks, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.40,0:02:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,扁他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:48.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,姓巴的 要你好看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare to die, Parrish!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.51,0:02:53.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,姓巴的 你急什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parrish, what's the rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.75,0:03:02.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他要去鞋厂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going to the factory!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:21.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,滚阿 夹尾巴的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on, Parrish!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.17,0:03:22.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去找你爹地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run to Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.11,0:03:24.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有种别出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:46.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,卡尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.20,0:03:47.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾伦老弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Alan, my man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.07,0:03:49.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过来看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta show you something. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.07,0:03:52.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我研究了快一年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been working on this all year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.57,0:03:54.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我约好下午见你父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got an appointment with your father...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.07,0:03:58.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要给他看...这个 你瞧瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to show him this. Go ahead, take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.98,0:04:01.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如何{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.31,0:04:02.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想他会喜欢吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think he'll like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.48,0:04:04.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:07.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老弟 这是未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it? This is the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.49,0:04:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果张伯伦穿这鞋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Wilt Chamberlain will wear them...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.49,0:04:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全国百姓都会抢着买{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...there'll be a pair of those in every closet in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.09,0:04:15.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定大大的流行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That will be the height of fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.66,0:04:18.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.50,0:04:23.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 没什么 - 艾伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nothing. - Alan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.44,0:04:26.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你来干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.84,0:04:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我说过 工厂不是游乐园 很危险的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This factory isn't a playground. It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.44,0:04:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想搭你的便车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I have a ride home?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.68,0:04:35.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比利又来惹你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Billy Jessup picking on you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.12,0:04:40.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你迟早要面对他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son, you're gonna have to face him sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.62,0:04:45.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管怕什么事 都要勇敢的面对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're afraid of something, you've got to stand and face it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.53,0:04:47.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, run on, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.97,0:04:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道他不该来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know better than to let the boy play here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:54.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 老板{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.70,0:04:56.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要我看什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was it you wanted to show me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.87,0:04:58.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我马上拿来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a minute, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.71,0:05:07.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么搞成这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the devil...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.90,0:05:25.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁干的好事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:27.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.67,0:05:33.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.85,0:05:50.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别以为你姓巴就可以钓我的马子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Being a Parrish doesn't mean you can hang around with my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.19,0:05:52.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们只是朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're just friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.99,0:05:54.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到此为止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.76,0:05:55.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,扁他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.87,0:06:02.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抢他的单车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got his bike!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.21,0:06:09.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:08:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.42,0:09:07.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.93,0:09:11.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是你吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you home?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.27,0:09:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,宝贝 怎么又被扁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alan, not again. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.47,0:09:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,勤奋 毅力 乐观...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hard work, determination, cheerful outlook...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.57,0:09:29.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这都是本镇居民的特质{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...attributes that exemplify Brantford spirit...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.41,0:09:32.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,创建以来始终如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...since our forefathers first settled this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.21,0:09:35.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,尽管此地气候严酷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Despite the harshness of our native clime
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.81,0:09:39.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,土壤坚硬无比 我们却能...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the granite of our soil...we have...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,欣欣向荣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prospered.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.65,0:09:44.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 早上明明记得的 - 今晚你也会记得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I knew it all this morning. - You'll know it all tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.66,0:09:46.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.16,0:09:48.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,山姆 我们得跟亚伦谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, we have to talk to Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.97,0:09:59.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们要走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.44,0:10:01.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我跟你父亲说了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told your father what you told me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.61,0:10:03.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对方不只比利一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that it wasn't just Billy Jessup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.91,0:10:05.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要是知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I'd known that,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.68,0:10:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 就不会... - 没关系 老爹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I wouldn't have... - It's okay, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.35,0:10:10.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过 你要知道 我很以你为荣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I want you to know that I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.35,0:10:14.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对方人多 你也不怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You faced them, even though you were outnumbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.25,0:10:18.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,既然你像个男子汉 因此我们决定...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since you took it like a man, your mother and I have decided...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.46,0:10:22.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,送你去念克利福塞男校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that you're ready to go to The Cliffside School for Boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:24.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恭喜我们的宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.80,0:10:28.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们不要我住在家里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want me living here anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.70,0:10:33.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们原本就有这想法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's always been the plan that you go to Cliffside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.04,0:10:38.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咱们巴家的人从18世纪开始就念的这所学校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, Parrishes have been going to Cliffside ever since the 1700s.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.48,0:10:40.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,包括你叔叔史凯勒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even your Uncle Skylar went there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.38,0:10:41.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.65,0:10:43.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"巴里斯馆"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parrish Hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.48,0:10:45.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是学校宿舍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the main dormitory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.27,0:10:52.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好极了 就因为我姓巴 他们才来找茬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is great. Kids are on my case here because I'm a Parrish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.82,0:10:54.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还叫我去住...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wait till
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.39,0:10:56.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,巴氏纪念宿舍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm living in a building named after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.50,0:10:58.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是纪念我父亲的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was named after my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.96,0:11:01.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 那你去住啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Why don't you live in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.30,0:11:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我住过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.73,0:11:05.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有那些岁月 就没有今天的我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't be who I am if it weren't for my years there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:08.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许我不想跟你一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I don't want to be who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.91,0:11:10.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,甚至不想当巴家的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I don't even want to be a Parrish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.31,0:11:19.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不够格 言行得像个样 去拿外套{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't be, not till you start acting like one.Get your coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,学校的事也免谈咯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I'm not ready for Cliffside, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.19,0:11:29.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下周日就去 不准再和我提这件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're taking you there next Sunday. I don't want to hear any other word about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.93,0:11:31.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你休想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.33,0:11:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我再也不跟你讲话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm never talking to you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:41.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 山姆 - 别提了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sam... - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.61,0:11:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 山姆 - 干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sam. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.11,0:11:45.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.24,0:12:13.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.74,0:12:16.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我把你的车送回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought your bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.31,0:12:17.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没必要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.24,0:12:20.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我自己会去找比利算账{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was going to Billy's to get it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.65,0:12:23.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫比利别再烦你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told Billy to stop picking on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.53,0:12:28.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是白费唇舌 我们改天再谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wasted your breath. We'll talk about it some other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.05,0:12:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.39,0:12:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也听见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.76,0:12:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.26,0:12:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这边走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.33,0:12:42.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我发现一个好怪的棋盘游戏 - 棋盘游戏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I found this really weird game in the factory. - A game?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:12:59.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,魔幻棋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jumanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.02,0:13:04.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"这个游戏为你设计 如果你想遗世独立{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"A game for those who seek to find a way to leave their world behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.69,0:13:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,丢骰子看走几步 掷出一对可继续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You roll the dice to move your token. Doubles gets another turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.86,0:13:11.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁先抵终点谁获胜" 要不要玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first to reach the end wins." You want to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.03,0:13:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,学前班的小孩才玩这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I quit playing board games five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.75,0:13:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莎拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.44,0:13:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定是磁力或是什么作用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gotta be magnetized or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:29.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾伦 你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alan, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.38,0:13:34.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"这种飞虫 昼伏夜出"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"At night they fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.45,0:13:35.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"快快逃命"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you better run.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.22,0:13:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"自求多福"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These winged things are not much fun."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.67,0:13:47.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.40,0:13:49.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.07,0:13:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 快拿走 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Put it away, Alan. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,糟糕...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.08,0:14:03.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它以为我掷了骰子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The game thinks I rolled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:06.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"它以为" 是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, "the game thinks"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.75,0:14:11.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"快到丛林孵豆芽"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"In the jungle you must wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.42,0:14:14.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"直到出现五或八"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...until the dice read five or eight."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.10,0:14:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"快到丛林孵豆芽"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the jungle you must wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.66,0:15:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(二十六年后)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:24.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,镇上确实需要个小客栈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bed and breakfast is just what this town needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.20,0:15:29.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,机会实在难得 何况还附家具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was pretty hard to pass up. Especially full of furniture.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.57,0:15:32.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我忘了这屋子应该这么大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I keep forgetting how big this place is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.34,0:15:34.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,朱蒂 彼德 快来看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy, Peter, come look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.11,0:15:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,柜台可以设在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna put a reception area right over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.91,0:15:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里是大厅 酒吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a bar over here in the parlour.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.45,0:15:47.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听起来很棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sounds lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.45,0:15:50.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你跟孩子们一定会很开心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you and your kids will be very happy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.26,0:15:54.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,实际上 他们是我的侄子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, they're my late brother's.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.03,0:15:57.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我兄嫂去年冬天死翘翘了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He and his wife passed away just last winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.70,0:16:03.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里很棒吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this something, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.14,0:16:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,的确{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.22,0:16:24.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你觉得如何 够不够大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think? Is it big enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.57,0:16:38.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,悲剧发生后...彼德就不说话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter hasn't spoken a word since it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.31,0:16:42.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的天...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.91,0:16:45.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是抱歉 太不幸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry. How terribly awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.51,0:16:47.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.91,0:16:50.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们跟父母也不熟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We barely even knew our parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.98,0:16:52.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们常年在外...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were always away...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.52,0:16:55.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是在瑞士滑雪 在摩纳哥赌钱...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skiing in St. Moritz, gambling in Monte Carlo...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.85,0:16:58.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是在非洲狩猎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...safariing in darkest Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.59,0:17:02.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也不知爱不爱我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't even know if they loved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.99,0:17:05.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但他们的游艇沉没时...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when the sheik's yacht went down...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.33,0:17:09.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们写了一封诀别书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they managed to write a beautiful goodbye note...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.33,0:17:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,塞在香槟酒瓶里在海上被人发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that was found floating in a champagne bottle amongst the debris.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.14,0:17:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.21,0:17:25.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我兄嫂很顾家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were very devoted parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.28,0:17:27.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在加拿大出了车祸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a car crash in Canada.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.35,0:17:28.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,契约就寄给我吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll send me the escrow papers?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.89,0:17:30.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明天一早{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First thing tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.55,0:18:04.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,得去找锁匠来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have to get a locksmith for this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.32,0:18:07.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,彼德 玩具收起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, pick up your toys, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.86,0:18:18.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,彼德 皮箱放进阁楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, take this suitcase up to the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:20.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后来吃冰淇淋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we can all have ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.34,0:18:21.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我来杯酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And bourbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.60,0:18:50.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.70,0:18:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要去住汽车旅馆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to Motel 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.61,0:18:55.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, for heaven's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.87,0:19:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没看见蝙蝠屎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see any guano.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:30.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他说像这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said it looked like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.14,0:19:32.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是非洲蝙蝠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's an African bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.64,0:19:35.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人说在60年代看过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some kid said she saw some back in the '60s...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.41,0:19:38.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新英格兰哪里会有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but we don't get bats like that in New England.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.65,0:19:40.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他明明看到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what he saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:42.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管是什么...反正已经没了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, whatever it was, it's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.06,0:19:48.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这房子 我倒不担心蝙蝠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bats aren't what I'd worry about in this house, anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.49,0:19:51.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你担心什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you worry about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.43,0:19:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就我个人来说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, personally...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.33,0:19:56.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可不住发生过凶案的房子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I wouldn't want to live where someone was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.07,0:20:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 凶案 - 对头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Murdered? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.51,0:20:03.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾伦·巴里斯 我猜是他父亲杀的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little Alan Parrish. I say his father did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.34,0:20:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这房子要藏尸体 容易得很{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's 1001 places he could've hid the body in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.68,0:20:12.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,特别是分尸之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially if he chopped it up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.85,0:20:14.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 上面的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.79,0:20:17.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,头一天上学 别迟到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want to be late for your first day of school.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.36,0:20:23.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,半只蝙蝠也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a bat in sight, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.70,0:20:24.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听到没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:28.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这房子没什么好怕的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing to be afraid of in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.39,0:20:58.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们刚上学... 校长就要请家长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe I have to see your principal after your first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.40,0:21:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如何是好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.40,0:21:04.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们先吃完晚饭...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's try to relax and finish dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.14,0:21:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,聊些别的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk about something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.57,0:21:09.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难怪这房子那么便宜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know why you got the house cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.84,0:21:12.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,26年前 一个叫艾伦·巴里斯的男孩住在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty-six years ago, a kid named Alan Parrish lived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:16.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有一天 他突然失踪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day he just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.08,0:21:20.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他父母把他分尸藏在墙壁里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His parents chopped him up and hid him in the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.85,0:21:24.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,够了 老是编谎话 罚你禁足{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. I'm sick and tired of your lies. You're grounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.93,0:21:31.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,无所谓 反正这鸟镇没处去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine, there's nowhere to go in this stupid town anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.86,0:21:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让你知道一下...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just for your information,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.87,0:21:35.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可没说谎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that wasn't a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.57,0:22:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有没有听见什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you hear anything a little wild?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.21,0:22:21.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想不想爸妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you miss Mom and Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.81,0:22:23.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.82,0:22:25.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,骗人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.72,0:22:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你再继续编谎话 会被送去看心理医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut that out, or they'll send you to a shrink.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.92,0:22:33.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不讲话 问题才大呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they gonna send you if you don't start talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.24,0:22:54.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果有耽搁 我会打电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I get held up at the permit office, I'll give you call.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.13,0:22:58.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,校车马上就到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The school bus will be here any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.68,0:23:01.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,钥匙拿了没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys still have your house keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.09,0:23:04.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的话听到没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.76,0:23:06.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.03,0:23:12.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 喂 - 怎么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.36,0:23:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我陪你们等车好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I should wait till the bus comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.03,0:23:18.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你父母会送你们上车吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did your parents used to put you on the bus?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.64,0:23:20.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.37,0:23:22.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,确定吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.44,0:23:25.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可以送你们去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could drop you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.71,0:23:29.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系 校车马上就到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, don't worry about us. The bus will be here any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.75,0:23:34.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天拜托乖一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Please be good today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.89,0:23:44.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你听见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.73,0:23:46.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听见什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hear what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.41,0:24:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从哪里传来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.78,0:24:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拿过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's bring it over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.20,0:24:52.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奇怪 粘住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weird. They're stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.37,0:24:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"这个游戏为你设计 如果你想遗世独立{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Jumanji, a game for those who seek to leave their worlds behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.80,0:25:01.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,丢骰子决定走几步 掷出一对可以继续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roll the dice to move. Doubles get another turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.54,0:25:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁先抵终点谁获胜"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first player to reach the end wins."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.38,0:25:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定是装了微晶片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gotta be microchips or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.75,0:25:16.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你先玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.89,0:25:24.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,六点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.84,0:25:41.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"只要轻轻叮一下 包你浑身都发麻"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"A tiny bite can make you itch, make you sneeze, make you twitch."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.55,0:26:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.16,0:26:28.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"达成任务难上难"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"This will not be an easy mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.83,0:26:31.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"成群泼猴来阻拦"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monkeys slow the expedition."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.73,0:26:36.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.51,0:27:19.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,猴子是游戏带来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet those monkeys came from the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.28,0:27:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,蚊子也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mosquitoes too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.68,0:27:27.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,糟糕 我没看见这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't see this part.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.69,0:27:32.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"冒险家注意..."{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Adventurers, beware."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.63,0:27:40.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"冒险家注意..."{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Adventurers, beware.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.70,0:27:43.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"游戏一开启 就得玩到底"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not begin unless you intend to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.80,0:27:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"游戏的风风雨雨 要它们如数散去"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The consequences of the game vanish when a player has reached Jumanji...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.97,0:27:49.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"得有人硬撑到底"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and called out its name."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.81,0:27:51.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 猴子跑了 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The monkeys are gone. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.98,0:27:53.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 把它丢了 - 等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Put it away. - Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.04,0:27:56.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它说玩到底 就没事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we finish the game, it'll all go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.98,0:27:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就这么办 否则姑姑会气疯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do it or Aunt Nora'll pitch a fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.32,0:28:03.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们得玩快点 反正不用技巧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should get through it quickly. I mean, there's no skill involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.32,0:28:07.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 你掷出一对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you rolled doubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.56,0:28:11.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以继续 掷啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get another turn. Roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.16,0:28:13.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,五点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.67,0:28:18.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"利齿巨虫"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"His fangs are sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.84,0:28:20.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"爱吃人"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He likes your taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.17,0:28:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"快快闪避"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your party better move
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.94,0:28:25.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"免遗恨"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}posthaste."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.01,0:28:28.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听起来怪恐怖的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.58,0:28:32.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.60,0:28:54.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是假的 彼德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not real, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.77,0:28:56.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我们的幻觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a hallucination.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.54,0:29:01.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快闪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run, Peter!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.07,0:30:36.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我回来了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.12,0:30:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小单车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.46,0:31:33.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁掷了五或八{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody roll a five or an eight?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.53,0:31:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.14,0:31:45.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,救星 救星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.48,0:31:48.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,救星 救星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.22,0:31:52.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 吓到你了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry if I scared you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.15,0:31:54.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 吓到你了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry if I scared you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.29,0:31:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.11,0:32:01.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老爹 老妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.49,0:32:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我到家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.06,0:32:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.63,0:32:08.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.23,0:32:10.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是艾伦 爸爸 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me, Alan, Mom and Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.90,0:32:12.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我到家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.74,0:32:14.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.07,0:32:17.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是不是妹妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you my little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.67,0:32:21.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是朱蒂 他是彼德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm Judy and he's Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.51,0:32:23.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈呢 爸在鞋厂吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Mom? Is Dad at the factory?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.98,0:32:26.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是不是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.65,0:32:28.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾伦·巴里斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Alan Parrish?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.99,0:32:30.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.99,0:32:31.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.59,0:32:33.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们现在住在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We live here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.19,0:32:37.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我爸妈呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's my mom and dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.76,0:32:39.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.33,0:32:42.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这房子空了好多年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This house has been empty for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.83,0:32:45.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家以为你死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.45,0:32:58.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.35,0:33:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 再说一遍 - 我说"红毛 长尾"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give me that description again. - Red fur and tails.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.37,0:33:21.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请你给我下车 到人行道上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down off of my car, please, and get up on the sidewalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.14,0:33:25.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请问今年是哪一年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What year is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.64,0:33:27.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是最新一年的车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was brand-new.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.36,0:33:33.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 今年是哪一年 - 1995 你忘啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. What year is it? - 1995, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.72,0:33:34.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有没有证件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got some I.D.?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.15,0:33:38.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在你的泰山装口袋里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess, it's in your other Tarzan outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.26,0:33:39.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,26年了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}26 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.49,0:33:41.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你住这一带吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you from around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.33,0:33:42.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,本是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.89,0:33:44.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,后来被魔幻棋吸走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I've been in Jumanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.73,0:33:45.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,印度尼西亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indonesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.73,0:33:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他参加和平工作团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was in the Peace Corps.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.90,0:33:50.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,班特利...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bentley...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.91,0:33:57.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 是卡尔·班特利 - 他是你亲戚吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carl Bentley, the sole man. - Is this man related to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.91,0:34:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他是我...姑丈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, he's our uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.84,0:34:02.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他常这样打扮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does he always dress like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.91,0:34:04.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 他是素食主义者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he's a vegetarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.19,0:34:08.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.86,0:34:14.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,猴子...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monkeys. Monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.63,0:34:18.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他没少根筋吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he all right upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.86,0:34:24.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他前阵子头受过伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He suffered a head injury a few months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.78,0:34:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你别走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you move!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.78,0:34:39.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,站住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.78,0:34:41.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跑死你娃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move, don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.55,0:34:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要去哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.45,0:34:46.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去找我父母{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To find my parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.13,0:34:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.25,0:35:17.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.24,0:36:13.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我爸爸以前在这里制鞋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad used to make shoes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.85,0:36:19.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新英格兰最好的鞋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were the best shoes in New England.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.93,0:36:31.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.83,0:36:35.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没事 别紧张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.14,0:36:42.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这鞋厂怎么啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what happened to the shoe factory?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.34,0:36:45.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,关掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it folded up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.48,0:36:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟镇上其他店家一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like everything else in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.06,0:36:52.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,外头冷 来杯咖啡吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's pretty cold out there. How about some coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.92,0:36:55.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,巴氏鞋厂为什么关掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would they close Parrish Shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.59,0:36:58.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,山姆的孩子失踪后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When his kid ran away, Sam
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.09,0:37:03.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他尽一切能力去寻找 所有的时间 金钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}put everything he had into finding him.His time, his money...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.49,0:37:04.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全部投入{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.60,0:37:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过了一阵子 他就不来工厂了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After a while, he stopped coming to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.03,0:37:10.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么都不在乎了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just quit caring.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.17,0:37:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有人像他那样爱孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think anybody loved his boy more than Sam did.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.94,0:37:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拿着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.51,0:37:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你会冻坏的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna freeze out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.38,0:37:26.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.52,0:37:29.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们夫妇还在吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are the Parrishes still around?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.05,0:37:31.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不时去看他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see them now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.29,0:37:36.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们住在亚当斯街{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're over on Adams Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.91,0:37:56.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们父母也不在了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our parents are dead too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.42,0:38:02.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们是在中东斡旋时...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were in the Middle East negotiating peace when...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.99,0:38:11.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我爸爸在广告界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our dad was in advertising.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.33,0:38:15.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你一定很想他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet you miss him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.43,0:38:17.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.94,0:38:23.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他又要走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he goes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.40,0:38:29.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我说 尽管你现在很失落 不过咱们得完成游戏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen I know you're upset, but we should finish the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.18,0:38:32.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们 何必找我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We? Why do you need me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.37,0:38:35.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,万一出现可怕的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just in case any other scary stuff comes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.79,0:38:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我姑姑房里有狮子 我怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plus there's a lion in my aunt's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.69,0:38:40.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你当我是马戏团的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I look like a Ringling Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.86,0:38:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她快回家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll be home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.36,0:38:44.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吓她一大跳 希望她不怕猫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't she be surprised? I hope she's not allergic to cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.38,0:39:03.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要拿担架 来帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Larry, we need the wheels. Give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.81,0:39:07.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 撞得厉害吗 - 不 是被怪虫叮的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did we hit her hard? - No, it looks like another weird bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.29,0:39:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 果然没错 - 已经五十多个了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, it's another one. - That's over 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.23,0:39:19.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么一回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.50,0:39:22.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,轻一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy now, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.40,0:39:24.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 看 那不是汤马斯太太吗 - 谁呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Isn't that Mrs. Thomas? - Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.73,0:39:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 中介公司那个 - 安静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The realtor. - Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.90,0:39:27.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.74,0:39:30.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听见没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.31,0:39:31.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听见什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hear what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.58,0:39:33.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.02,0:39:41.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想想看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, think.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.75,0:39:43.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么东西比我先出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What came out of the game before me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.09,0:39:47.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,狮子 一群猴子 还有...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a lion, a bunch of monkeys and...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.52,0:39:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.93,0:39:53.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没事...只是个虫子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, it's okay. It's just a bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.03,0:39:55.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里很安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're safe in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.87,0:39:57.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看到没没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See we're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.34,0:40:03.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要坐低一点 就叮不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we stay low, he can't get through there too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.54,0:40:06.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别担心 没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you worry. We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.08,0:40:09.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它进不来 有玻璃挡住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can't get through the glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.28,0:40:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们很安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.45,0:40:16.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们会开车吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know how to drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.05,0:40:18.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不会 小意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No? That's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.29,0:40:22.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我爹曾让我倒车到汽车道上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad used to let me back the car down the driveway.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.56,0:40:23.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有一次经验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.29,0:40:26.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没什么难的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.80,0:40:27.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上路了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.70,0:40:33.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.38,0:40:41.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,车顶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The top!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.26,0:41:00.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小事一桩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.32,0:41:21.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.95,0:41:23.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要拿那玩意靠近我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep that thing away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.69,0:41:30.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你何时才要玩 我姑姑就快回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When are you gonna help us play? Our aunt will be home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.76,0:41:34.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 你就告诉她 她已被扫地出门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. You can inform her that she's the ex-owner of this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.03,0:41:39.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我父母既然不在 我就是这里的主人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you realize with my parents gone, this home belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.87,0:41:44.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢天谢地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.04,0:41:48.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不必用香蕉叶子了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more banana leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.72,0:41:57.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那些猴子会破坏生态环境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think those monkeys will do to the ecosystem?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.99,0:42:01.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们坐好 听我说命运的故事吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just sit right back And you'll hear a tale of a fateful trip
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.99,0:42:05.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们乘坐小船从热带港口出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That started out in this tropic port aboard this tiny ship
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.23,0:42:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,强壮的水手 勇敢的船长...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mate was a mighty sailing man. The skipper brave and sure
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.33,0:42:16.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,5个乘客出海 34小时的旅游{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five passengers set sail that day. For a three-hour tour
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.69,0:42:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.19,0:42:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用玻璃刮脸吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you shave with a piece of glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.26,0:42:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你又怎么了 输了钱回家啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to you? Did the Clampetts have a yard sale?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.20,0:42:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这辈子第一次刮胡子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never shaved before.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.20,0:42:44.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要去哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.93,0:42:49.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我跟彼德玩 你看着就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about Peter and I play, and you just sort of watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.51,0:42:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢 我看过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.11,0:42:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不帮忙 那要干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you won't help us, what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.28,0:42:56.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.78,0:42:58.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,继续过我的日子吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty much take up where I left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.95,0:43:01.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看倪老师是否还教六年级{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder if Mrs. Niedermeyer's still teaching sixth grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.46,0:43:14.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,算了 他不会帮忙的 他怕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, he's not gonna help us. He's afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.30,0:43:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.53,0:43:19.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.97,0:43:21.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怕成乌龟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay to be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.81,0:43:26.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们去客厅玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's set it up in the living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.55,0:43:33.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们不知道这玩意的厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea what you're getting yourself into.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.32,0:43:36.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好坏我们会自己应付 不用你帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it is, we can handle it. We don't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.49,0:43:39.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.99,0:43:42.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们以为猴子 蚊子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think monkeys, mosquitoes
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.49,0:43:44.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有狮子很凶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and lions are bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.26,0:43:45.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这才刚开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.16,0:43:50.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我见过的东西 你们做恶梦时才会出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen things you've only seen in your nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.00,0:43:53.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,连想都想不到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things you can't even imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.50,0:43:56.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看也看不见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things you can't even see.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.27,0:44:00.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有些东西每晚来找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are things that hunt you in the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.34,0:44:03.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有些不停尖叫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then something screams.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.68,0:44:05.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你听见他们在吃东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you hear them eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.02,0:44:08.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就祈祷你别变成甜点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you hope to God that you're not dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.29,0:44:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.29,0:44:14.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们还不知道何谓害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't even know what afraid is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.53,0:44:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有我 你们活不到五分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not last five minutes without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.13,0:44:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.30,0:44:22.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,欢迎你的加入{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're gonna help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.80,0:44:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我看你们玩...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll watch...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.94,0:44:33.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.43,0:44:46.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,彼德 你刚才好酷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, that was very cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.89,0:44:50.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这叫激将法 爸爸常用来对付我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's reverse psychology. Dad used to pull it on me all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.06,0:44:52.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,准备好没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.23,0:44:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾伦好了没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alan, ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.97,0:44:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没法准备的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no "ready".
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.91,0:45:11.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我再试一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll try it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.09,0:45:21.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾伦 没动静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alan, it's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.20,0:45:33.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,糟了 不是轮到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.87,0:45:36.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊我先掷 然后彼德 掷两次 现在又该我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I rolled first. Then Peter twice because he got doubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.78,0:45:39.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在又该我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it's my turn again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.21,0:45:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.28,0:45:43.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,两个棋子是你们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two of the pieces are yours, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.68,0:45:45.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,另两个是谁的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's the other pieces?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.02,0:45:50.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大象是我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The elephant was mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.22,0:45:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,69年开始的那盘还没完{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're playing the game I started in 1969.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.23,0:45:59.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要玩才行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna have to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.70,0:46:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不该我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.57,0:46:09.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那该谁呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whose turn is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.81,0:46:14.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莎拉·惠特尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarah Whittle.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.92,0:46:25.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她以前住这地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where she used to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.59,0:46:28.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她住鬼屋阿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place gives me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.94,0:46:42.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们常在阳台上玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We used to play on this porch.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.34,0:46:45.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(通灵大师 丝灵娜夫人)
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.84,0:46:48.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她一定不住这里 可能跟比利都结婚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She doesn't live here. She probably married Billy Jessup.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.74,0:46:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 来都来了 - 不妨打听一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - Let's at least ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.95,0:46:55.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 说不定她知道 - 当然 她能通灵嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe she'll know where Sarah went. - She'll know. She's a psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.19,0:46:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有道理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.86,0:47:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以前阳台比较大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember the porch being a lot bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.76,0:47:06.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,帮个忙好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.96,0:47:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有没有预约{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have an appointment?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.63,0:47:10.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有 我们在找个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we're trying to find someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.70,0:47:12.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,丝灵娜夫人在忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madam Serena can't see anyone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.97,0:47:14.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或许你能帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you can help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.64,0:47:19.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.38,0:47:22.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我找个人 以前住这儿的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're looking for someone who used to live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.11,0:47:25.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一直住这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I've lived here my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.48,0:47:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你一定认识莎拉·惠特尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you must know Sarah Whittle.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.56,0:47:34.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们找她干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want with Sarah Whittle?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.13,0:47:37.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莎拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarah?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.50,0:47:41.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我已经改名了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't go by that name anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.13,0:47:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莎拉·惠特尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarah Whittle?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.90,0:47:47.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.41,0:47:53.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,26年前 你跟邻居一个男孩玩个游戏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty-six years ago, you played a game with a little boy down the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.01,0:47:58.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有鼓声的游戏...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A game with drums.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.09,0:48:04.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.16,0:48:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就是那个男孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was that little boy, Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.93,0:48:13.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alan?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.04,0:48:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你害死她了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.71,0:48:29.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请留言 大夫会尽快回话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave a message and the doctor will call you back at his earliest convenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.71,0:48:30.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,鲍大夫...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Boorstein,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.05,0:48:34.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是莎拉·惠特尔 请尽快给我回话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's Sarah Whittle. Please call me as soon as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.55,0:48:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的药剂量需要检查{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I need to have my dosage checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.59,0:48:41.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们常谈的那件事... 你说并未发生的那件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That event we've been discussing, the one that didn't really happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.03,0:48:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天我碰到那个...并未失踪的男孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm having an episode here with the boy who didn't really disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.56,0:48:49.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在他家客厅 喝柠檬汁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sitting in his living room, drinking lemonade.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.57,0:48:50.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请回电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you could call me,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.87,0:48:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我很想听听你的解释{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd really be interested in your interpretation.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.87,0:48:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 他一会就会打来 - 反正也是闲着...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He'll call me back. - While we're waiting...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.31,0:49:00.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 妈呀！不不不！ - 莎拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- God! No, no, no! - Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.31,0:49:06.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我心理治疗好久 才相信没发生过这诡异的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've spent 2000 hours in therapy convincing myself that didn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.08,0:49:09.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我认为是我在幻想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to you was so awful. I made it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.75,0:49:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,的确很可怕...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was awful. It was awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.15,0:49:13.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.52,0:49:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但那是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.33,0:49:21.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不对 你父亲把你杀了 还把你剁碎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it wasn't real. Your father murdered you and chopped you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.83,0:49:23.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莎拉 别胡说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarah, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.00,0:49:25.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我父亲会那么做?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.84,0:49:29.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我父亲难得抱我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father could barely hug me...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.70,0:49:33.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,更别提把我剁碎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...let alone cut me into little pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.51,0:49:35.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,26年前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty-six years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.68,0:49:38.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们开始了一场游戏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we started playing a little game.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.61,0:49:39.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.02,0:49:42.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们要坐下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we're all gonna sit down
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.69,0:49:44.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把游戏玩完{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we're gonna finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.79,0:49:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你猜怎样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.79,0:49:47.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.80,0:50:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,掷吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Play the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.61,0:50:04.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 不 不 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, no, no. - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.94,0:50:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,骰子给我 回家去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just give me the dice and you can go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.28,0:50:08.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不玩没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.16,0:50:12.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾伦 你人太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.65,0:50:13.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,骗子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.65,0:50:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.28,0:50:16.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这叫丛林法则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the law of the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.05,0:50:18.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,慢慢就习惯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.65,0:50:21.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我还一直当你是个善鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I think of the energy I spent visualizing you as a radiant spirit...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.83,0:50:24.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快念吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on, read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.97,0:50:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"此物生长快过春笋"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"They grow much faster than bamboo.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.40,0:50:35.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"不想被捉步步留神"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care or they'll come after you."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.85,0:50:39.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.58,0:50:42.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,告诉我 这只是幻觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God. Tell me this isn't happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.18,0:50:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可惜不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.85,0:50:46.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别靠近墙壁 别碰其他东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay away from the walls. Don't touch anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.25,0:50:50.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别做大动作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No quick movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.99,0:50:58.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 好漂亮 - 可不是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're beautiful. - Yeah, they're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.59,0:51:01.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别碰紫色的 它会射出毒刺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch the purple ones. They shoot poisonous barbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.75,0:51:06.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,尤其要远离又大又黄的花苞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And definitely stay away from the pods. The big yellow ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.60,0:51:07.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么又大又黄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What big yellow ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.88,0:51:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,捉住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you! Get his arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.11,0:51:17.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把它扯掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get it off me! Get it off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.72,0:51:27.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.90,0:51:35.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抓紧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.95,0:51:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我马上来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got him? I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.64,0:51:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爷爷失礼了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Angus.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.24,0:51:48.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,收割时刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harvest time!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.39,0:51:57.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.50,0:52:07.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.93,0:52:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的车...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My car.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.50,0:52:12.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.84,0:52:13.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请回答...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carl please...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.34,0:52:16.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有谁看见卡尔了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dose anybody see Carl?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.84,0:52:18.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有这种事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.34,0:52:19.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托 发动...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start, start, please. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.74,0:52:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 卡尔 请回答 - 我是卡尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carl? Come in, Carl. - Carl here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.61,0:52:28.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你死哪去了 好多动物到处乱窜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where have you been? We've got an animal control situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.28,0:52:31.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,叫史丹和威利去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get Stan and Willy on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.70,0:52:35.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要去姓巴的老家看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've gotta check out a suspicious character at the Parrish place.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.29,0:52:37.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我该进消防队才对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should've been a fireman.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.14,0:52:48.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莎拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarah!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.23,0:52:52.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放开我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your hands off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.37,0:52:53.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,游戏还没完呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The game is not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.98,0:52:55.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对我来说完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.44,0:52:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里不是丛林{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are not in the jungle anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.28,0:53:01.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,住手 不能这样对我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop this! You don't treat people like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.86,0:53:17.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有谁要冰茶我来泡茶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody up for iced tea? I'm gonna make some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.94,0:53:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托 上次我玩了下 一辈子就毁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alan please, last time I played this game it ruined my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.68,0:53:30.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的一辈子毁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ruined your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.78,0:53:33.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"快到丛林孵豆芽"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"In the jungle you must wait
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.68,0:53:36.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"直到出现五或八"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}till the dice read five or eight."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.35,0:53:39.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我当时是个小女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a little girl, Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.02,0:53:41.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.03,0:53:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一群蝙蝠...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a bunch of bats
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.89,0:53:47.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,包围着我 追着我到马路上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}surrounded me and chased me down the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.80,0:53:49.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我当时害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.03,0:53:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 艾伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.90,0:53:55.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没人相信我 我好孤单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one believed me. I was alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.92,0:54:02.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莎拉 我也是 转眼26年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So was I, for 26 years, Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.58,0:54:03.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.30,0:54:09.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系 莎拉 我们也害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, Sarah. We're scared too.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.92,0:54:12.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要玩完 这些就会消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if we finish the game, it'll all go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.82,0:54:15.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,万一我被困住呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I get stuck in the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.72,0:54:16.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.73,0:54:21.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为我会玩下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I won't stop playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.40,0:54:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And neither will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.00,0:54:24.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't either.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.68,0:54:34.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧 莎拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.51,0:54:35.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.85,0:54:46.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就知道今天日子不好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew this was gonna be a bad day.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.86,0:54:49.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.63,0:54:50.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.76,0:54:52.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要保持冷静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just have to keep our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.10,0:54:56.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没什么大不了的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And roll with the punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.88,0:55:16.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"蛮荒僻野"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"A hunter from
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.12,0:55:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"一猎神"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the darkest wild...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.06,0:55:22.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"鲁莽射击不留人"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...makes you feel just like a child."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.39,0:55:25.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.89,0:55:27.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,范培特...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Van Pelt.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.34,0:55:38.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没用的孬种 回来跟我决斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You miserable coward! Come back and face me like a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.25,0:55:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,准头不够{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not good enough, Sonny Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.02,0:55:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看你往哪跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming, ready or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.51,0:56:11.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 听着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.28,0:56:19.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,枪扔掉 手举高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop your gun and get your hands in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.81,0:56:47.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有这种事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, I don't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.20,0:56:57.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,即使艾伦平安无事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if Alan gets out of this situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.64,0:57:00.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,事情也会不断重演{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it'll happen over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.41,0:57:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人长期压抑怒气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you carry repressed anger,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.74,0:57:04.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吸收了许多负能量 就会出事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it attracts a lot of negative energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.95,0:57:09.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,例如陷身丛林{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things happen, like ending up in the jungle. That was no accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.22,0:57:10.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这不是没道理的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.65,0:57:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该谁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whose turn is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.75,0:57:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.22,0:57:15.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好极了 继续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.55,0:57:18.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你应该讲明有这号人物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might've told us there was a man who hunts people.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.49,0:57:21.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我哪知道 骰子掷了才晓得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know. It's just a roll of the dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.56,0:57:23.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为这个 你才不想玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he the reason you didn't want to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.23,0:57:28.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你本来也不想玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't want to play, either?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.50,0:57:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还说什么 游戏开始了 就得结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. We started 26 years ago and now we gotta finish it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.11,0:57:36.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你跟他有何瓜葛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.78,0:57:41.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他是猎人 以打猎为业 现在他要捕杀我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a hunter. He kills things. Right now, he wants to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.45,0:57:42.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 为何找上你 - 为何找上我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why you? - Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.92,0:57:46.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知道 也许他讨厌我的样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. You'd think it'd be a waste of his time.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.02,0:57:48.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或是他想装饰墙壁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I'd look good on his wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.45,0:57:50.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.52,0:57:53.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们不能沟通一下吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever talked with him about your differences?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.79,0:57:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你疯啦 他拿着枪...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you crazy? The man has a gun...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.20,0:57:57.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不准说我疯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't ever call me crazy Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.70,0:57:58.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,永远不准{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.20,0:58:03.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我说出你给棋盘吸走了 大家都说我疯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone's called me crazy ever since I said you were sucked into a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.75,0:58:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我来继续掷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I should roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.60,0:58:06.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,赞成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.72,0:58:09.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家当我是凶案的目击者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was the girl who saw you murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.03,0:58:11.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我14岁生日没人来参加派对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did anyone come to my 14 birthday party?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.54,0:58:13.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要掷了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, I'm rolling now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.61,0:58:14.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 什么比利 - 我掷了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Billy who? - I am gonna roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.95,0:58:15.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么忘啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you an owl?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.76,0:58:18.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托 丝灵娜女士 挖挖你的潜意识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Madam Serena,dig into your consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.29,0:58:20.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,掷吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, just roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.55,0:58:22.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找出你的老相好比利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find the memory of your old boyfriend Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.40,0:58:24.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抢你单车那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The kid who'd steal your bicycle?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.52,0:58:26.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,带你去看电影那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The kid who took you to the movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.96,0:58:31.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"听个清楚 不是打雷 按兵不动 可要倒霉"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Don't be fooled, it isn't thunder. Staying put would be a blunder."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.40,0:58:32.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你早熟 - 你才早熟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're immature. - You are!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.20,0:58:36.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你肯定是的 至于我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you are, but what am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.90,0:58:38.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有没有感觉到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.97,0:58:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仔细听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.86,0:59:04.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.33,0:59:06.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,动物惊群了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.93,0:59:10.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,游戏带着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The game!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.94,0:59:18.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别回头看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.37,0:59:47.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.81,0:59:58.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你干嘛不拿好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you grab the game, Peter?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.38,1:00:00.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别理他 他是天秤座的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ignore him. He's a Libra.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.25,1:00:02.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 他要去哪 - 它会去水边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are you going? - He'll head for water!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.92,1:00:04.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.16,1:00:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是你阿姨 你跑哪去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Aunt Nora. Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.33,1:00:10.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 你拨错号了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, dear. You have the wrong number.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.27,1:00:15.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.85,1:00:36.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 要买什么 - 我要这种子弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What can I do for you? - I'll have a gross of these.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.36,1:00:39.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种1903年就停产了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They stopped making these in 1903.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.76,1:00:41.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.19,1:00:44.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只好连枪也换了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I shall need a replacement weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.53,1:00:45.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要等一段日子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a waiting period.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.37,1:00:48.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还得先填申请表{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you'll have to fill out these.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.20,1:00:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可以代填{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or I could fill these out.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.51,1:00:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,路易斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Louise.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.71,1:01:02.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是有人问起...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, anyone asks,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.78,1:01:04.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别说在这儿买的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you didn't get this here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.05,1:01:11.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是邮差吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not a postal worker, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.03,1:01:17.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alan!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.45,1:01:22.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小声点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.47,1:01:52.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,彼德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.09,1:02:58.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,彼德 你还好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.91,1:03:01.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 没想到你那么厉害 - 你太酷了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't believe you did that. - That was so cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.57,1:03:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 换了我 腿都软了 - 太棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You gave me chills. - It was great.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.77,1:03:08.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,干得好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice work. Come on,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.91,1:03:10.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,东西给我 走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}give me the game. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.01,1:03:31.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真倒霉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.46,1:03:33.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,装自然一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Act natural.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.20,1:03:39.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把它藏起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hide the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.71,1:03:46.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每次有麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time there's trouble,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.81,1:03:49.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都碰到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I run into you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.55,1:03:51.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我怎么 我不懂你的意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me? I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.95,1:03:54.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 跟我到局里 - 哪也不去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm taking you in. - I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.89,1:04:02.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下 别带他走 他是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a second. You can't take him, he's...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.06,1:04:04.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她的未婚夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her fianc?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.40,1:04:05.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他不是你姑丈吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute.You said he's your uncle.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.50,1:04:09.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系 我马上回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.31,1:04:15.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blast!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.07,1:04:18.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说不会背弃朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you'd never abandon your friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.58,1:04:20.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 等会再玩 - 等会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We'll finish the game later. - Later?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.65,1:04:23.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,范培特在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Van Pelt. Van Pelt.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.18,1:04:26.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我奉劝你们即刻回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suggest you all go home now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.33,1:04:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在怎么玩得完{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now how are we supposed to finish the game?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.33,1:04:38.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没他就玩不成了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't. We can't finish it without him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.20,1:04:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,朱蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.03,1:04:43.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.27,1:04:46.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.54,1:04:49.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想自己玩完 我只差十步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I could end the game. I was only 10 spaces away.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.01,1:04:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"游戏规则 若有违背"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"A law of Jumanji hadn't been broken...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.54,1:04:54.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"略施薄惩 棋子退回"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you will slip back more than your token."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.11,1:04:57.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想作弊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tried to cheat?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.88,1:05:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我把骰子轻轻放下 弄出十二点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I tried to drop the dice so they landed on 12.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.35,1:05:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就是作弊了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, honey. Well, that would be cheating.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.29,1:05:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,彼德 你的手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, your hands!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.69,1:05:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看你的手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at your hands!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.32,1:05:35.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是威利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in, this is Willy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.92,1:05:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,动物朝巴氏公园前进 我挡不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They cleaned out Larry's Hardware.I can't stop them.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.62,1:05:42.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快请求军队支援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the National Guard down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.66,1:05:45.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是怎么回事 我知道你清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this about? I know you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.50,1:05:49.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错 但说了你也不相信 卡尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I do. But you wouldn't believe me even if I told you, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.33,1:05:51.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么知道我叫卡尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. How do you know my name is Carl?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.74,1:05:54.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道的可多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know a lot more than that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.67,1:05:57.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你以前在巴氏鞋厂工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You used to work at Parrish Shoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.94,1:05:59.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大伙叫你"鞋底师"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They used to call you "Sole Man".
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.35,1:06:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"鞋底师" 没错 我本来在那上班{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sole Man, that's right. I was in there too...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.75,1:06:05.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,后来被开除了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...till old man Parrish fired me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.94,1:06:06.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 他把你炒了 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He fired you? - Yeah, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.95,1:06:11.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而我有样东西原本可挽救全镇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I had something that could've turned this whole town around.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.69,1:06:12.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你设计的鞋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your shoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.36,1:06:14.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.63,1:06:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,卡尔...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Carl?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.36,1:06:20.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然说迟了26年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it doesn't mean much after 26 years...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.43,1:06:21.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.43,1:06:23.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.10,1:06:26.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry for what?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.44,1:06:28.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是艾伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me. Alan.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.05,1:06:35.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.38,1:06:36.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.22,1:06:39.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,显然是商店在打折{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, apparently there's a sale, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.32,1:06:48.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刚才骑车的是猴子吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saw three monkeys on a motorcycle, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.46,1:06:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 是的 - 看来我没疯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.46,1:06:54.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说不定能保他出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we can bail him out with a cheque.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.48,1:06:55.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.23,1:06:59.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟那个胆小鬼说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell that snivelling coward if he wants...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.03,1:07:10.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,滚开 滚开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.33,1:08:04.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that, boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.17,1:08:07.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,救命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.97,1:08:09.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拉我出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.08,1:08:11.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 没关系 - 彼德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's all right. - Oh, my God, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.97,1:08:27.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.44,1:08:42.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.84,1:08:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这等我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.35,1:08:54.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,逮到你了 姑娘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha, girlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.92,1:08:59.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾伦知道你被抓就会来找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When Alan hears of your predicament, he'll come.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.79,1:09:03.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他不知道我在这儿 这招没用 再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't know I'm here. It won't work. Your plan's ruined.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.80,1:09:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 别动 否则宰了你 - 明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move and I'll blow your brains out! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.20,1:09:10.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快叫警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call the cops!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.94,1:09:12.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 这样他就知道了 - 高明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That should do the trick. - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.48,1:09:19.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,扫描售价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Price check!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.61,1:09:21.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(未卖出)
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.95,1:09:26.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放了我 就能收拾局面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you let me go, I can stop all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.22,1:09:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听来难以置信 但我没骗你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like "The Twilight Zone", but it's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.72,1:09:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托帮个忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, you gotta help me on this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.39,1:09:35.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一定会后悔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I'm gonna regret this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.83,1:09:38.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just hold still.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.07,1:09:42.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 你自由了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, I let you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.30,1:09:44.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now what are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.84,1:09:47.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你留在这里 - 我的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're staying here. - My keys!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.74,1:09:49.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是为了你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.57,1:09:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我的手铐钥匙 - 实在对不起了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My handcuff keys! - I have to do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.59,1:09:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 艾伦 - 你将来会感谢我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alan! - You'll thank me someday.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.98,1:09:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,卡尔 紧急情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carl, code red.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.51,1:09:59.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一名女子 两名儿童在多省超市遭劫持{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hostage situation at Sir Sav-a-lot. A woman and two children.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.85,1:10:03.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嫌犯似乎是你先前所说的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It sounds like the armed perpetrator in the pith helmet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.42,1:10:05.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,卡尔 请回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carl? Come in, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.68,1:10:07.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么是"多省超市"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's Sir Sav-a-lot?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.69,1:10:09.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 是平价量贩店 - 过去过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a discount store. - Move over.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.76,1:10:11.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 轻一点 - 就这样 就这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait. Gently, gently. - All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.33,1:10:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别紧张 我会开车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, I've done this before.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.40,1:10:18.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,曾今有一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.21,1:10:24.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,救命啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.36,1:10:42.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,超市在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Sir Sav-a-lot?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.13,1:10:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 门罗路 榆树街口 - 在教堂旁边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Monroe and Elm. - The Episcopal church.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.03,1:10:47.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在改成汉堡店了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anymore. Now it's a Speedy Burger.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.47,1:10:51.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,至少原本是的 不知还在不在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least it was. I don't know what's left. People are going loopy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.35,1:10:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,朱蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.98,1:11:05.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人追来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got company.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.98,1:11:08.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系 是交通警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. He'll back us up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.79,1:12:03.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 游戏到手了 - 我们快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here's the game. - Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.84,1:12:11.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,臭老鼠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rats!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.15,1:12:31.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,关掉警笛 就是那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn the siren off. Right there!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.09,1:12:33.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.19,1:12:44.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,闭嘴女人 要杀你早就杀了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop cringing, I could have shot you at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.52,1:12:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你为何不下手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.86,1:12:48.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,骰子不是你掷的 我找艾伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't roll the dice, Alan did.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.53,1:12:49.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.59,1:12:50.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,踩煞车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit the brakes!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.86,1:12:51.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,煞车...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit the brakes!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.30,1:12:57.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我踩啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit the brakes!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.97,1:12:59.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他应该快到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.81,1:13:22.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莎拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarah!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.63,1:13:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你没事 - 恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you okay? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.50,1:13:25.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,彼德呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Peter?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.50,1:13:27.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.50,1:13:31.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.97,1:13:38.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因此要记住 周遭环境 永远在你掌握之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So remember, circumstances are never, ever out of your control.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.25,1:13:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,第三卷结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}End of tape three.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.25,1:13:46.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,布兰福特镇骚动的最新消息...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Update on the extraordinary events in Brantford, New Hampshire.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.99,1:13:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,至少已有98人住院...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}98 people have been hospitalized with symptoms...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.99,1:13:53.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,症状包括发烧 出疹和突发癫痫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... ranging from inexplicable fevers and rashes to seizures.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.93,1:13:56.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,地方当局疲于应付{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Local resources are strained to the breaking point.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.53,1:14:01.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,州卫生局呼吁民众 若有类似症状 请拨911{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And state officials are now asking those with such symptoms to dial 911.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.98,1:14:49.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.58,1:14:54.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾伦 安慰他一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alan, talk to him, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.25,1:14:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我哪有时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? We don't have time for this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.72,1:14:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他是个孩子 只是想帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, but he's a kid and he was trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.49,1:15:02.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 好吧 - 我带他谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right, come on. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.33,1:15:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,朱蒂 来一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.93,1:15:08.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我曾经警告过你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I warned you about this, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.94,1:15:12.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但你就是不听 还要玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you wanted to play the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.07,1:15:15.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在哭吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.67,1:15:17.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别哭 不要气馁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't cry, you keep your chin up.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.08,1:15:20.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来 振作一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, keep your chin up.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.85,1:15:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哭永远解决不了问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crying never helped anybody do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.62,1:15:25.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,碰到问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you have a problem,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.08,1:15:27.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就要勇敢地面对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you face it like a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.76,1:15:38.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.30,1:15:41.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在丛林待了26年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty-six years buried in the deepest jungle...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.97,1:15:43.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仍然免不了像我父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I still became my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.04,1:15:45.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来 对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. Come here, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.87,1:15:47.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.54,1:15:51.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说过的 害怕也没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right to be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.21,1:15:52.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不是害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.55,1:15:54.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.56,1:16:10.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,准备好没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.57,1:16:14.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.80,1:16:18.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们马上就把你变回原形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll have you back to your old self in no time flat.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.67,1:16:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们这就进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because we'll go in here together,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.34,1:16:23.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,坐下来 把游戏结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sit down and finish that game.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.14,1:16:25.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不论发生...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.68,1:16:26.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...what.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.82,1:16:41.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我好像真正回到了家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suddenly, I feel right at home.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.44,1:16:52.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(车门未关)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.73,1:17:16.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,洛莲 这是卡尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine, this is Carl.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.46,1:17:20.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道问题所在 我要去巴氏旧宅 请派人支援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm heading over to the Parrish place. Give me some backup.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.85,1:17:25.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,洛莲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lorraine?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.15,1:17:30.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.08,1:17:32.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.48,1:17:33.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,停车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.08,1:17:35.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.15,1:17:40.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有什么问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.82,1:17:42.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能不能送我回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I have a ride home?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.65,1:17:46.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你住哪里 - 杰弗逊街 巴氏旧宅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where do you live? - Jefferson Street. The old Parrish place.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.42,1:17:48.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你有没有小孩 一男一女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have children? A boy and a girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.23,1:17:50.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,发生什么事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.76,1:17:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上车 路上慢慢说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in. I'll explain it all on the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.69,1:18:24.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好嘛拿去算了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine! Take it!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.13,1:18:26.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点去你家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get to that house.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.87,1:18:34.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去别处玩吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shouldn't we play someplace else?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.37,1:18:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 我在这种环境长大 外头更恐怖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.I grew up in this. It's out there that scares me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.94,1:18:41.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.55,1:18:44.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莎拉 掷个十二点 你就赢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarah, if you roll a 12, you win.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.82,1:18:48.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,准备好 要掷了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, ready? Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.49,1:18:54.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.16,1:18:57.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"每月月逢二分圆"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Every month at the quarter moon,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.50,1:18:59.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"大雨降临..."{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there'll be a monsoon...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.06,1:19:01.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"浊浪滔天"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in your lagoon."
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.83,1:19:03.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monsoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.74,1:19:05.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,至少我们在屋里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least we're inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.41,1:19:08.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可不是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.20,1:19:33.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下点雨也无妨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, a little rain never hurt anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.22,1:19:36.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太多了淹死人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But a lot can kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.68,1:19:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咱们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.34,1:19:40.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这边走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.11,1:19:47.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.55,1:19:54.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,往高处走 别走散了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get to higher ground. Come on! Stay together!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.30,1:20:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.62,1:20:13.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 艾伦 - 在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alan? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.97,1:20:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.25,1:20:20.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈呀 快闪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swim! Swim! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.88,1:20:26.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快逃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swim! Go! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.75,1:20:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,继续走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.06,1:20:35.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,坐在桌上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay on the table!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.60,1:20:38.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,脚离开水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feet out of the water!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.27,1:20:43.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到吊灯上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the chandelier!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.11,1:20:54.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莎拉 来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.96,1:21:10.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,坚持一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on, Sarah!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.22,1:21:15.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,受伤没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.95,1:21:41.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,朱蒂 彼德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy? Peter!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.13,1:21:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小姐 交给我处理 可能没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Step back and let me handle this, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.91,1:21:49.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能电视的声音开大了点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing. They probably left the TV on too loud.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.57,1:21:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就等这一天 小心了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always wanted to do this. Could you step back, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.36,1:22:16.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,手伸过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.27,1:22:22.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抓住我的手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab my hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.77,1:22:23.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抓住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.39,1:22:46.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拿着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.53,1:22:55.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你没事吧 - 恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.21,1:23:04.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你为了我 跟美洲鳄鱼搏斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alan, you wrestled an alligator for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.31,1:23:09.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是非洲鳄鱼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.42,1:23:13.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美洲鳄鱼特征不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alligators don't have that fringe on their hind leg.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.65,1:23:15.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.49,1:23:21.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我搞错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.45,1:23:42.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.56,1:23:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 该我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.02,1:23:52.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.19,1:23:55.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们就像福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Mustard in the library with the wrench.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.70,1:24:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,答案就在游戏中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clue.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.01,1:24:14.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"注意你站的地方"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Beware the ground on which you stand.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.15,1:24:17.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"地板不如你想象"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The floor is quicker than the sand."
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.92,1:24:24.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,救我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.02,1:24:25.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,保持冷静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.02,1:24:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要挣扎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't struggle.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.16,1:24:30.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 保持冷静 - 我很冷静啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stay calm. - I'm calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.26,1:24:31.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抓住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab on!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.43,1:24:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.60,1:24:36.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抓住了 拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it. Pull!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.60,1:24:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,冷静 冷静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay calm!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.17,1:24:43.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.48,1:24:47.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, good!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.40,1:24:51.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就好了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.62,1:24:54.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别给我会散开的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop giving me things that come apart!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.29,1:24:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"有个教训..."{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"There is a lesson..."
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.20,1:25:01.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.46,1:25:04.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"有个教训宜记取"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"There is lesson you will learn."
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.30,1:25:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我抓住你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.07,1:25:11.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"有时得先退回去"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Sometimes you must go back a turn."
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.71,1:25:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你痛不痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I hurt you?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.71,1:25:17.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.81,1:25:23.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你 朱蒂 你脑筋转得快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Judy. Thank you. That was very quick thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.88,1:25:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莎拉和我想要站起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarah and I would like to get out of the floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.72,1:25:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,彼德 该你掷了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your turn, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.43,1:25:39.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我以为又要失去你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I'd lost you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.50,1:25:41.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你没走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for sticking around this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.41,1:25:49.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"需要人手别慌张"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Need a hand ? Why you just wait
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.34,1:25:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"七手八脚来帮忙"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll help you out. We each have eight."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.02,1:26:03.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.92,1:26:08.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 没事 - 没事干嘛哇哇叫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nothing. - You don't go "Ah!" for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.34,1:26:13.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,彼德 去院子工具间找把斧子 快去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter, my dad kept an axe in the woodshed. Go get it!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.10,1:26:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快去快回{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.55,1:27:01.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,朱蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.64,1:27:04.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,彼德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.10,1:27:28.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,劳拉阿姨 是我 彼德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aunt Nora, it's me. Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.45,1:27:37.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 我很忙 等会再解释{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. I can't talk right now. I'll explain later.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.92,1:27:39.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 莎拉 - 干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sarah. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.35,1:27:40.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.45,1:27:43.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 掷个七点 就结束了 - 我没办法掷 把骰子放在嘴里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can finish if you roll 7. - I can't roll.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.23,1:27:47.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 把骰子放在嘴里 - 朱蒂 把游戏搬过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Put the dice in your mouth. - Judy bring the game. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.72,1:27:55.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,朱蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.71,1:28:03.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.98,1:28:05.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没事 去帮他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine. Help them.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.95,1:28:13.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快来 朱蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Judy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.32,1:28:16.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把骰子给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the dice.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.83,1:28:28.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"紧要关头目标近"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"You're almost there with much at stake.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.07,1:28:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"地牛翻身陷困境"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now the ground begins to quake."
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.01,1:28:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真希望爸妈在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish Mom and Dad were here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.52,1:28:46.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do I.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.10,1:29:00.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只有游戏结束 才活得成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her only chance is if we finish the game!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.07,1:29:02.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在该你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your turn!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.97,1:29:04.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈妈呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.72,1:29:19.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抓住游戏盒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the game!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.05,1:29:21.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不要放开你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't let you go!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.08,1:29:50.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不许动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.15,1:29:57.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,站起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.26,1:30:04.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,手里拿着什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's in your hand?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.26,1:30:08.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,丢掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.78,1:30:20.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没路走了 小伙子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}End of the line, Sonny Jim.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.85,1:30:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,游戏到此为止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Game's up.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.18,1:30:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,赶紧跑路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start running.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.78,1:30:26.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.45,1:30:30.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.96,1:30:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我怕死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm terrified.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.39,1:30:34.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我父亲说过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my father told me...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.13,1:30:38.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要面对害怕的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you should always face what you're afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.40,1:30:44.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good lad.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.87,1:30:47.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你终于成了男子汉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're finally acting like a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.97,1:30:50.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有什么遗言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any last words?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.65,1:31:02.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,魔幻棋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jumanji.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.32,1:31:06.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我说魔幻棋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Jumanji.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.16,1:31:10.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Alan, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.08,1:32:41.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我忘了带演讲稿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forgot my speech notes.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.09,1:32:47.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我好高兴你回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, I'm so glad you're back.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.33,1:32:51.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我才去了五分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've only been gone 5 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.00,1:32:55.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我觉得好像很久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems like a lot longer to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.27,1:33:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是说不跟我说话吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were never going to talk to me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.21,1:33:05.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,无论我说了什么 老爹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever I said, Dad,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.54,1:33:07.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.12,1:33:12.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾伦...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Alan,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.68,1:33:14.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我刚才很生气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was angry.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.69,1:33:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也很抱歉 对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry too, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.23,1:33:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.63,1:33:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果你不想念克利福塞 我不勉强你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you don't have to go to Cliffside if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.23,1:33:31.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们明天再谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's talk it over tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.14,1:33:33.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,两个大男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man-to-man.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.37,1:33:38.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像父子好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about father to son?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.71,1:33:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.58,1:33:45.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我得走了 我是主客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've gotta get going. I'm the guest of honour.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.07,1:33:50.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.59,1:33:55.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在196...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back in 196...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.39,1:33:56.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.59,1:33:57.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天在鞋厂的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}today in the factory...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.50,1:34:00.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不能怪卡尔·班特利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it wasn't Carl Bentley's fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.73,1:34:02.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我把鞋子放在生产线上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put the shoe on the conveyer belt.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.60,1:34:07.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很高兴你告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad you told me, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.94,1:34:10.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.51,1:34:12.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再见 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.84,1:34:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.19,1:34:27.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 天哪朱蒂和彼德 - 艾伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Holy smokes! Judy and Peter! - Alan.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.53,1:34:30.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们不在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not there.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.10,1:34:34.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在是1969年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's 1969.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.97,1:34:36.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们还没出世呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't even exist yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.33,1:35:10.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我快忘了当大人的滋味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm forgetting what it's like to be a grownup.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.40,1:35:11.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's okay,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.07,1:35:13.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要我们互相记得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as long as we don't forget each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.41,1:35:15.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有朱蒂和彼德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or Judy and Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.41,1:35:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有件事我一直想做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something I've been wanting to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.15,1:35:24.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最好现在就做... 免得又像小孩什么都不敢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I better do it before I feel too much like a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.10,1:35:47.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,六年级不教开车吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They probably don't teach driver training in the sixth grade, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.95,1:36:04.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.62,1:36:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要不要尝尝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want any cookies?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.40,1:36:17.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸 是两用气垫式 销路好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, the new cross-trainer's doing fabulous.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.11,1:36:19.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是胸罩 是鞋子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's not a bra, it's a shoe.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.47,1:36:20.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, they're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.45,1:36:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸 我得挂了 圣诞快乐 明天来机场接你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, I gotta run. We'll pick you up tomorrow, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.31,1:36:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们就是最好的礼物 拜拜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be the best Christmas gift of all. Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.64,1:36:29.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们到了 我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're here? Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.91,1:36:34.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,借过 借过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.54,1:36:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很高兴你们能来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim! Glad you could make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.71,1:36:39.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 谢谢 这是我妻子 玛莎 - 这是莎拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks. This is my wife, Martha. - Hi. This is Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.99,1:36:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你好莎拉 - 孩子呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, Sarah. - Where are the kids?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.99,1:36:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的天来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, there they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.00,1:36:47.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.57,1:36:51.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然是猜的 孩子嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A guess, of course. They're your kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.34,1:36:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,猜对了 他们正是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, these are our children.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.84,1:36:56.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,朱蒂和彼德 见过巴先生 巴太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judy and Peter. Say hi to Mr. And Mrs. Parrish.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.91,1:36:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,幸会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.24,1:36:59.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,幸会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.68,1:37:02.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟我记忆中一摸一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just like we remembered you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.52,1:37:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我觉得跟他们很熟 因为...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like we know so much about them.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.92,1:37:13.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你常跟艾伦谈起 - 我又跟内人说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You've told Alan about them. - And I told her.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.93,1:37:16.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我去拿礼物 - 好 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll get the presents. - Sure, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.79,1:37:19.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们很喜欢小孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we love children.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.60,1:37:20.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞快乐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.93,1:37:22.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.37,1:37:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你哪天开始上班{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When can you start?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.80,1:37:30.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们想度假时去滑雪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were going to take a skiing
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.37,1:37:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去加拿大的洛矶山脉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}holiday up in the Canadian Rockies.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.21,1:37:34.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.95,1:37:36.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.38,1:37:38.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们在想...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.62,1:37:41.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新产品的广告得立刻开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Need you to get that marketing done on the new line.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.72,1:37:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没问题 那就下周开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problem. I could start next week.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.72,1:37:46.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.72,1:37:49.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我给你介绍几个未来的同事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me introduce you to the folks you'll be working with.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.63,1:37:51.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.63,1:37:53.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我家就是你家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our house was your house.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.23,1:37:55.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,随时欢迎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is.Anytime you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.24,1:38:07.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that sound?
